<title>FRANCE: Sligos sells Soliac to Schlumberger.</title>
<headline>Sligos sells Soliac to Schlumberger.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>French firm Sligos said on Monday it planned to sell its Solaic unit to Schlumberger for 365 million francs ($69.7 million).</p>
<p>Schlumberger said on November 9 it had signed a letter of intention for the acquisition.</p>
<p>The sale and price were confirmed in a statement from the French seller.</p>
<p>($ = 5.239 French Francs)</p>
</text>
